From 85432569305b0c4df6e0973468314a2342bced9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RushVR Move fork <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:42:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Quest controllers as PlayStation Move wands

Implements libSceMove on top of the headset's own controllers (right =
first wand, left = second), tracks both wands in libSceVrTracker, reads
the Touch controllers' buttons, trigger, stick and haptics through
OpenXR, and turns the launcher's Controllers card on. Enabled with
SHADPS4_QUEST_MOVE=1 (controllers=quest); the DualSense path is
unchanged otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011WML1cF3Vk7U9nsxKAqLov
